{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，多名用户在Reddit及OpenAI官方開發者社區反映，自己的ChatGPT賬號突然遭到停用，其中包括每月訂閲費用為200美元的Pro用户。部分用户表示，賬號被封前沒有收到任何通知，長期積累的聊天記錄和工作資料也因此無法訪問。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585460.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.655066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:12:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"85d9768ae1f185e7efbd84a8e25c8a47bc11da30da61a0fab9a546205e6318b0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}